## Since April

<QueueTimeline ticket={4471} />

## Triage lesson

- Matching subjects is useful for finding related reports, but it can hide separate causes.
- Count unique report IDs and group by tenant configuration plus channel, not by intake tag.
- Keep one summary page for the incident, then track one engineering issue per cause.

